#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Continue the 854 untouched Open14B slots without retrying the historical 46.

WSL: --run, --watch, --status, --collect, --stop, --self-test.
Generate one original five-arm block (first remaining block has four slots),
stop the owned model, validate/measure, seal/archive, and continue automatically.
A request timeout is terminal for that slot, not for the campaign. Corrupt inputs,
unsafe execution settings and numeric infrastructure errors still stop safely.
The model, prompts, native tokens, sampling, output caps and numeric helpers are
unchanged. Scheduling/error-handling revisions are recorded as an amendment.
"""
